    "finding": "r003 visibly reduces the original heavy repeated stacked-ring pattern: terraces are fewer, weaker, angularly warped/unequal, and no longer dominate the whole cluster. Longitudinal drip ribs/grooves are plainly legible in side and rear, readable in hero/reversehero, and remain volumetric in the clay render. Residual small horizontal ledges remain, especially on shorter front columns, so bounded recommendation rather than an unqualified quality claim. Five unequal solid rounded floor-rooted columns and crust remain clear; top shows closed convex tops, no holes or hanging stalactites."
